-
-<h2>How Theology Becomes a Weapon</h2>
-
-<p>Abuse does not always look like a fist. The most insidious form of abuse in the church is the form that operates through theology — that uses the language of Scripture, the structures of the church, and the authority of God to control, diminish, and silence.</p>
-
