-<blockquote>Leaving your father and mother is not an act of cruelty. It is an act of obedience — obedience to the God who designed marriage to supersede the family of origin, who knew that the new thing could not flourish if the old thing maintained its grip, and who asked you to do something painful because the marriage He gave you is worth the cost.</blockquote>
