-<h2>The Fix Is Not a Better Devotional</h2>
-
-<p>So the answer to the family devotional nobody wants to do is usually not a better devotional book or more discipline or more guilt. It is often to loosen the formal thing dramatically and to thicken the informal thing everywhere else. To stop measuring your faithfulness by whether you completed the evening program and start measuring it by whether God is a real, discussed, present part of your family's ordinary life.</p>
