-<p>When people say they left the church because of "hypocrisy," they are not making a naive observation that Christians sometimes fail to live up to their ideals. Everyone fails to live up to their ideals. What they are describing is something more specific and more damaging: a systematic gap between what the church publicly proclaims and what it institutionally practices.</p>
